{1000}{The Mayor of Grayhills wants you to save his village from a Mummy that was last seen on the outskirts of town. He believes the Mummy is hiding in some dark caves that are in the area.}
{1001}{Tim, the Gossip of Grayhills, says there is a book at the Library called 'The Story of Amtut'. He says you should read it and then come back and talk to him. Apparently the book will give you some more information about the Mummy.}
{1002}{The Librarian at the Grayhills Public Library wants you to return the overdue book 'All Guns Blazin'. It was lent out to the Bartender of 'The Rathouse'.}
{1003}{The Bartender of 'The Rathouse' wants you to exterminate all the rats in his cellar.}
{1004}{It seems you need to find out some more information about the Mummy from Mr Pollock. Tim, The Town Gossip, says he is probably cutting firewood down Shearers Drive on the southern outskirts of town.}
{1005}{The Sheep Farmer, Mr Pollock, needs his axe repaired so that he can cut down trees to use for firewood during the coming winter.}
{1006}{Mr Pollock wants you to cut down the three Big Trees at the end of the path for him.}
{1007}{It seems that there is nothing more to do now except to go into the old abandoned mines outside of town and find the Mummy.}